{"id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-godel-numbering.md","title":"Effective Syntax and Sequence Coding","display":"df-godel-numbering — Effective Syntax and Sequence Coding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-godel-numbering","aliases":["89-df-godel-numbering"],"display":"df-godel-numbering — Effective Syntax and Sequence Coding","depends_on":["[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","[[89-df-effective-computation]]"],"created":"2026-10-09","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-godel-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-godel-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-numbering — Effective Syntax and Sequence Coding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec3012ebbfa291bf\" href=\"?note=ec3012ebbfa291bf\" title=\"89-df-first-order-formula\">89-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3997bfb78544d69c\" href=\"?note=3997bfb78544d69c\" title=\"89-df-effective-computation\">89-df-effective-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ec3012ebbfa291bf\" href=\"?note=ec3012ebbfa291bf\" title=\"89-df-first-order-formula\">89-df-first-order-formula</a> 的一阶签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_C:C\\to\\omega\">\\(\\kappa_C:C\\to\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_F:F\\to\\omega\">\\(\\kappa_F:F\\to\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_P:P\\to\\omega\">\\(\\kappa_P:P\\to\\omega\\)</span> 为给定单射。假设下述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EffSig}(\\mathcal L,\\kappa_C,\\kappa_F,\\kappa_P)\">\\(\\mathsf{EffSig}(\\mathcal L,\\kappa_C,\\kappa_F,\\kappa_P)\\)</span>；符号的有效表示就是这些指标，元数的有效性采用其数值延拓，不再依赖未展开的“有效签名”约定。PA 实例仍固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_C(0)=0\">\\(\\kappa_C(0)=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_F(S)=0\">\\(\\kappa_F(S)=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_F(+)=1\">\\(\\kappa_F(+)=1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_F(\\times)=2\">\\(\\kappa_F(\\times)=2\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\varnothing\">\\(P=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>递归式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in P\">\\(R\\in P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^{a_F(f)}\">\\(\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^{a_F(f)}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^{a_P(R)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^{a_P(R)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>；序列编码式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,n,a,b\\in\\omega\">\\(i,n,a,b\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star\\notin\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\star\\notin\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 为失败标记。下述解码在合法像上取唯一原像，在其余码上返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star\">\\(\\star\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 不是任何语法树码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{sub}\">\\(\\mathsf{sub}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{all}\">\\(\\mathsf{all}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{OneVar}\">\\(\\mathsf{OneVar}\\)</span> 的指定自由变元为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>；其他变量使用带指标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sub}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sub}\\)</span>。尖括号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 及 PA 专用条款的语法参数限于 PA 的项或公式；一般签名的参数仍用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(g_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>。这些是元语言数值运算，其对象语言图表示由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76cab88fafa3b379\" href=\"?note=76cab88fafa3b379\" title=\"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation\">89-df-primitive-recursive-representation</a> 的接口在使用处引入，不把数值函数直接当作 PA 原始函数符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\pi(a,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\frac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b,\\quad\n\\pi_0(n)\\coloneqq\\min\\{a\\le n\\mid\\exists b\\le n\\ \\pi(a,b)=n\\},\\quad\n\\pi_1(n)\\coloneqq\\min\\{b\\le n\\mid\\pi(\\pi_0(n),b)=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle a\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}s)\\coloneqq1+\\pi(a,\\mathsf{seq}(s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{unseq}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf{unseq}(n+1)\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_0(n)\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathsf{unseq}(\\pi_1(n)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{nd}(t,s)&amp;\\coloneqq1+\\pi(t,\\mathsf{seq}(s)),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(0,i),\\langle\\rangle),\\quad\ng_{\\mathcal L}(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(1,\\kappa_C(c)),\\langle\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(2,\\kappa_F(f)),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(t_i)\\mid i&lt;|\\vec t|\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(t\\doteq u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(3,0),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(t),g_{\\mathcal L}(u)\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(4,\\kappa_P(R)),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(t_i)\\mid i&lt;|\\vec t|\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(5,0),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(A)\\rangle),\\quad\ng_{\\mathcal L}(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(6,0),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(A),g_{\\mathcal L}(B)\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(\\forall v_i A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(7,i),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(A)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L}[\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)],\\quad\n\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L}[\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)],\\quad\n\\mathsf{SC}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L}[\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathcal L}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}A,&amp;A\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ g_{\\mathcal L}(A)=n,\\\\\n\\star,&amp;n\\notin\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L}\\cup\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathcal L},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\ulcorner A\\urcorner&amp;\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\quad\n\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\quad\n\\mathsf{SC}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{SC}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\\\\n\\mathsf{num}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\bar n\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Sub}(a,i,t)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\ulcorner\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a)[v_i:=\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(t)]\\urcorner,\n&amp;a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ t\\in\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\\\0,&amp;a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\lor t\\notin\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{OneVar}(b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ (b=\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\land\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{all}(b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\ulcorner\\forall v_0\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(b)\\urcorner,&amp;b\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\0,&amp;b\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{imp}(a,c)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\ulcorner\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a)\\to\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(c)\\urcorner,&amp;a,c\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\0,&amp;a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\lor c\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{sub}(b,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Sub}(b,0,\\mathsf{num}(n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathcal L}(g_{\\mathcal L}(A))&amp;=A,\\quad\n\\mathsf{unseq}(\\mathsf{seq}(s))=s,\\quad\\mathsf{seq}(\\mathsf{unseq}(n))=n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\pi(a,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\frac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b,\\quad\n\\pi_0(n)\\coloneqq\\min\\{a\\le n\\mid\\exists b\\le n\\ \\pi(a,b)=n\\},\\quad\n\\pi_1(n)\\coloneqq\\min\\{b\\le n\\mid\\pi(\\pi_0(n),b)=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle a\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}s)\\coloneqq1+\\pi(a,\\mathsf{seq}(s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{unseq}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf{unseq}(n+1)\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_0(n)\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathsf{unseq}(\\pi_1(n)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{nd}(t,s)&amp;\\coloneqq1+\\pi(t,\\mathsf{seq}(s)),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(0,i),\\langle\\rangle),\\quad\ng_{\\mathcal L}(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(1,\\kappa_C(c)),\\langle\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(2,\\kappa_F(f)),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(t_i)\\mid i&lt;|\\vec t|\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(t\\doteq u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(3,0),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(t),g_{\\mathcal L}(u)\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(4,\\kappa_P(R)),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(t_i)\\mid i&lt;|\\vec t|\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(5,0),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(A)\\rangle),\\quad\ng_{\\mathcal L}(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(6,0),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(A),g_{\\mathcal L}(B)\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(\\forall v_i A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(7,i),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(A)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L}[\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)],\\quad\n\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L}[\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)],\\quad\n\\mathsf{SC}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L}[\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathcal L}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}A,&amp;A\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ g_{\\mathcal L}(A)=n,\\\\\n\\star,&amp;n\\notin\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L}\\cup\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathcal L},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\ulcorner A\\urcorner&amp;\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\quad\n\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\quad\n\\mathsf{SC}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{SC}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\\\\n\\mathsf{num}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\bar n\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Sub}(a,i,t)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\ulcorner\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a)[v_i:=\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(t)]\\urcorner,\n&amp;a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ t\\in\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\\\0,&amp;a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\lor t\\notin\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{OneVar}(b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ (b=\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\land\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{all}(b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\ulcorner\\forall v_0\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(b)\\urcorner,&amp;b\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\0,&amp;b\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{imp}(a,c)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\ulcorner\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a)\\to\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(c)\\urcorner,&amp;a,c\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\0,&amp;a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\lor c\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{sub}(b,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Sub}(b,0,\\mathsf{num}(n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathcal L}(g_{\\mathcal L}(A))&amp;=A,\\quad\n\\mathsf{unseq}(\\mathsf{seq}(s))=s,\\quad\\mathsf{seq}(\\mathsf{unseq}(n))=n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{All}(i,a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\ulcorner\\forall v_i\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a)\\urcorner,&amp;a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n0,&amp;a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\n\\end{cases}\\quad(i,a\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{all}(a)&amp;=\\mathsf{All}(0,a),\\quad\n\\mathsf{All}:\\omega^2\\to\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{All}(i,a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\ulcorner\\forall v_i\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a)\\urcorner,&amp;a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n0,&amp;a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\n\\end{cases}\\quad(i,a\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{all}(a)&amp;=\\mathsf{All}(0,a),\\quad\n\\mathsf{All}:\\omega^2\\to\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nI_K&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\kappa_K)\\quad(K\\in\\{C,F,P\\}),\\\\\n\\widehat a_F(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}a_F(f),&amp;f\\in F,\\ \\kappa_F(f)=n,\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin I_F,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\widehat a_P(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}a_P(R),&amp;R\\in P,\\ \\kappa_P(R)=n,\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin I_P,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{EffSig}(\\mathcal L,\\kappa_C,\\kappa_F,\\kappa_P)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\\bigwedge_{K\\in\\{C,F,P\\}}\n\\exists d_K:\\omega\\to\\{0,1\\}\\left(\\operatorname{Comp}(d_K)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (d_K(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in I_K)\\right)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(\\widehat a_F)\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(\\widehat a_P),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall K\\in\\{C,F,P\\}\\ \\forall n\\in I_K\\ \\exists!s\\in K\\ (\\kappa_K(s)=n),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{Comp}(n\\mapsto\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L}}(n))\\land\n\\operatorname{Comp}(n\\mapsto\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathcal L}}(n))\\land\n\\operatorname{Comp}(n\\mapsto\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{SC}_{\\mathcal L}}(n)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nI_K&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\kappa_K)\\quad(K\\in\\{C,F,P\\}),\\\\\n\\widehat a_F(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}a_F(f),&amp;f\\in F,\\ \\kappa_F(f)=n,\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin I_F,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\widehat a_P(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}a_P(R),&amp;R\\in P,\\ \\kappa_P(R)=n,\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin I_P,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{EffSig}(\\mathcal L,\\kappa_C,\\kappa_F,\\kappa_P)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\\bigwedge_{K\\in\\{C,F,P\\}}\n\\exists d_K:\\omega\\to\\{0,1\\}\\left(\\operatorname{Comp}(d_K)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (d_K(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in I_K)\\right)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(\\widehat a_F)\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(\\widehat a_P),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall K\\in\\{C,F,P\\}\\ \\forall n\\in I_K\\ \\exists!s\\in K\\ (\\kappa_K(s)=n),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{Comp}(n\\mapsto\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L}}(n))\\land\n\\operatorname{Comp}(n\\mapsto\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathcal L}}(n))\\land\n\\operatorname{Comp}(n\\mapsto\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{SC}_{\\mathcal L}}(n)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条在 89 内给出原有“固定标准有效 Gödel 编码”参数的具体实现，保留尖括号码、数词、替换等调用接口；没有改变任何已经在本书给出具体算式的模态编码。解码按自然数递减：合法节点的各子树码严格小于父节点码。一般有效签名只承诺可计算；PA 的固定有限签名及本书所用检查运算可用原始递归实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-effective-computation","status":"resolved","id":"3997bfb78544d69c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-effective-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)$ 为 [[89-df-first-order-formula]] 的一阶签名；$\\kappa_C:C\\to\\omega$、$\\kappa_F:F\\to\\omega$、$\\kappa_P:P\\to\\omega$ 为给定单射。假设下述 $\\mathsf{EffSig}(\\mathcal L,\\kappa_C,\\kappa_F,\\kappa_P)$；符号的有效表示就是这些指标，元数的有效性采用其数值延拓，不再依赖未展开的“有效签名”约定。PA 实例仍固定 $\\kappa_C(0)=0$、$\\kappa_F(S)=0$、$\\kappa_F(+)=1$、$\\kappa_F(\\times)=2$，且 $P=\\varnothing$。","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation","status":"resolved","id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{sub}$、$\\mathsf{all}$、$\\mathsf{OneVar}$ 的指定自由变元为 $v_0$；其他变量使用带指标的 $\\mathsf{Sub}$。尖括号 $\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 及 PA 专用条款的语法参数限于 PA 的项或公式；一般签名的参数仍用 $g_{\\mathcal L}$。这些是元语言数值运算，其对象语言图表示由 [[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]] 的接口在使用处引入，不把数值函数直接当作 PA 原始函数符号。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_C:C\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_F:F\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_P:P\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{EffSig}(\\mathcal L,\\kappa_C,\\kappa_F,\\kappa_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_C(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_F(S)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_F(+)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_F(\\times)=2","display":false},{"tex":"P=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^{a_F(f)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^{a_P(R)}","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"i,n,a,b\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\star\\notin\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\star","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{sub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{all}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{OneVar}","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"g_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\pi(a,b)&\\coloneqq\\frac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b,\\quad\n\\pi_0(n)\\coloneqq\\min\\{a\\le n\\mid\\exists b\\le n\\ \\pi(a,b)=n\\},\\quad\n\\pi_1(n)\\coloneqq\\min\\{b\\le n\\mid\\pi(\\pi_0(n),b)=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle\\rangle)&\\coloneqq0,\\quad\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle a\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}s)\\coloneqq1+\\pi(a,\\mathsf{seq}(s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{unseq}(0)&\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf{unseq}(n+1)\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi_0(n)\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathsf{unseq}(\\pi_1(n)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{nd}(t,s)&\\coloneqq1+\\pi(t,\\mathsf{seq}(s)),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(v_i)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(0,i),\\langle\\rangle),\\quad\ng_{\\mathcal L}(c)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(1,\\kappa_C(c)),\\langle\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(f(\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(2,\\kappa_F(f)),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(t_i)\\mid i<|\\vec t|\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(t\\doteq u)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(3,0),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(t),g_{\\mathcal L}(u)\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(R(\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(4,\\kappa_P(R)),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(t_i)\\mid i<|\\vec t|\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(5,0),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(A)\\rangle),\\quad\ng_{\\mathcal L}(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(6,0),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(A),g_{\\mathcal L}(B)\\rangle),\\\\\ng_{\\mathcal L}(\\forall v_i A)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(7,i),\\langle g_{\\mathcal L}(A)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L}&\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L}[\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)],\\quad\n\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L}[\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)],\\quad\n\\mathsf{SC}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L}[\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathcal L}(n)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}A,&A\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ g_{\\mathcal L}(A)=n,\\\\\n\\star,&n\\notin\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L}\\cup\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathcal L},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\ulcorner A\\urcorner&\\coloneqq g_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\quad\n\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\quad\n\\mathsf{SC}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{SC}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\\\\n\\mathsf{num}(n)&\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\bar n\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Sub}(a,i,t)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\ulcorner\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a)[v_i:=\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(t)]\\urcorner,\n&a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ t\\in\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\\\0,&a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\lor t\\notin\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{OneVar}(b)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ (b=\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\land\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{all}(b)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\ulcorner\\forall v_0\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(b)\\urcorner,&b\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\0,&b\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{imp}(a,c)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\ulcorner\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a)\\to\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(c)\\urcorner,&a,c\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\0,&a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\lor c\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{sub}(b,n)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Sub}(b,0,\\mathsf{num}(n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathcal L}(g_{\\mathcal L}(A))&=A,\\quad\n\\mathsf{unseq}(\\mathsf{seq}(s))=s,\\quad\\mathsf{seq}(\\mathsf{unseq}(n))=n.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{All}(i,a)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\ulcorner\\forall v_i\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a)\\urcorner,&a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n0,&a\\notin\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\n\\end{cases}\\quad(i,a\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{all}(a)&=\\mathsf{All}(0,a),\\quad\n\\mathsf{All}:\\omega^2\\to\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nI_K&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\kappa_K)\\quad(K\\in\\{C,F,P\\}),\\\\\n\\widehat a_F(n)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}a_F(f),&f\\in F,\\ \\kappa_F(f)=n,\\\\0,&n\\notin I_F,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\widehat a_P(n)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}a_P(R),&R\\in P,\\ \\kappa_P(R)=n,\\\\0,&n\\notin I_P,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{EffSig}(\\mathcal L,\\kappa_C,\\kappa_F,\\kappa_P)\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\\bigwedge_{K\\in\\{C,F,P\\}}\n\\exists d_K:\\omega\\to\\{0,1\\}\\left(\\operatorname{Comp}(d_K)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (d_K(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in I_K)\\right)\\right]\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(\\widehat a_F)\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(\\widehat a_P),\\\\\n&\\forall K\\in\\{C,F,P\\}\\ \\forall n\\in I_K\\ \\exists!s\\in K\\ (\\kappa_K(s)=n),\\\\\n&\\operatorname{Comp}(n\\mapsto\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{TC}_{\\mathcal L}}(n))\\land\n\\operatorname{Comp}(n\\mapsto\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathcal L}}(n))\\land\n\\operatorname{Comp}(n\\mapsto\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{SC}_{\\mathcal L}}(n)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":6941,"backlinks":[{"id":"d773e54334af93ea","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]"},{"id":"8ab645f955c77848","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0fcc108fa2ae7636","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\ \\urcorner$ 与 $\\overline n$ 取 [[89-df-godel-numbering]]、[[89-df-numeral]]。$\\tau^B_r$ 的其余递归子句与原文相同。"},{"id":"00938a3b569dba72","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2695165f0444a6d1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"编码、数词和避免捕获的同时替换取 [[89-df-godel-numbering]]、[[89-df-numeral]]；$\\mathrm{ucl}$ 是自由变元的有序全称闭合。"},{"id":"4cc05e68647fcda4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9aca87310232fb2f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6cbce44a943995a0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"995dd9138f5c3e5a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$；$\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg S=\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\{\\neg S\\}$。$\\mathsf{OneVar},\\mathsf{all},\\mathsf{imp},\\mathsf{sub}$ 是 [[89-df-godel-numbering]] 中指定变量 $v_0$ 的数值操作。"},{"id":"f748d191ce42f6ef","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce269af4e544b5ee","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0d2469f2990d6f49","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"396f9d3c403d0603","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bf85e6f6750f6f5e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"22c2c4cecc692616","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1db7bc84524d0fdb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"76b37345e1a3ad95","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-numeral]]、[[89-df-godel-numbering]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"[[89-df-function]] → [[89-df-effective-computation]] → [[89-df-godel-numbering]]／[[89-df-modal-godel-code]]：明确函数限制、编码参数及有效签名条件。"}],"outgoing":["ec3012ebbfa291bf","a2